.* WRKOBJPGP: the objects whose primary group is a group profile. No
.* golden: the pub400 account may not see another profile.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=KINDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=PGP CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=KINDCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJATR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OPT OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJATR OBJTEXT'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/PGKEYS' NAME=PGKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display names only
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOBJPGP KEYL=PGKEYS HELP=WRKOBJPGP ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Objects by Primary Group
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGP' VAR=PGP USAGE=OUTPUT.Primary group
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS VIEWS=2.(No objects have this primary group)
:LISTACT HELP='WRKOBJPGP/OPTIONS' OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD EDTOBJAUT OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.2=Edit authority
:LISTACT HELP='WRKOBJPGP/OPTIONS' OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4'.4=Delete
:LISTACT HELP='WRKOBJPGP/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPOBJAUT OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.5=Display authority
:LISTACT HELP='WRKOBJPGP/OPTIONS' OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD DSPOBJD OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.8=Display description
:LISTACT HELP='WRKOBJPGP/OPTIONS' OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD ?CHGOBJPGP OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.9=Change primary group
:LISTCOL HELP='WRKOBJPGP/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJ' VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJLIB' VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJTYPE' VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJATR' VAR=OBJATR USAGE=OUTPUT.Attribute
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJTEXT' VAR=OBJTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJATR OBJTEXT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 2, 5, 8 and 9 or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKOBJPGP.Work with Objects by Primary Group - Help
:P.The objects a group profile is the primary group of. Type an option
next to an object to look at or change its authority or give it
another primary group.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/PGKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F11=Display names only
:PD.Shows the list with the names alone, so more fit on a page.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGP'.Primary group
:P.The primary group shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKOBJPGP/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:P.The object of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJATR'.Attribute
:P.The attribute of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKOBJPGP/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Edit authority
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to edit authority it. The
Edit Object Authority (EDTOBJAUT) command runs for the entry.
:PT.4=Delete
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to delete it.
:PT.5=Display authority
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display authority it. The
Display Object Authority (DSPOBJAUT) command runs for the entry.
:PT.8=Display description
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to display description it.
The Display Object Description (DSPOBJD) command runs for the entry.
:PT.9=Change primary group
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to change primary group it.
The Change Object Primary Group (CHGOBJPGP) command is prompted for the
entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
